            "review_title": "Review at Xien Khe",
            "review_text": "Jan F\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam56 contributions\n0\nduck tongues and squid mouths\nJun 2018 • Family\nI had heard of the duck tongues at this restaurant and had to try them, they were served with a garlic and sweet sauce about 6 to a serving, they were tasty but actually just a soft tendon like consistency and I had come just for the experience, we also had squid mouths in a hot sauce these I've had before and enjoyed picking at them, served with rice. This made an enjoyable evening out with my wife, daughter and her boyfriend. Would I have duck tongue again, possibly if they were on the menu, but I wouldn't go out of my way for them, squid mouths I usually order when we see them at a clam or snail restaurant.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 18, 2018",
